<h3 class="font-luxury text-white h4 mt-5 mb-3">False Ceiling Designs &amp; Lighting Layouts</h3>
<p class="text-muted">We install gypsum ceilings with cove LED strip lights and magnetic spotlight tracks, adding visual spaciousness and modern style to your Sanpada home.</p>
<p class="text-muted">These track lighting systems allow you to slide, rotate, or exchange spotlight panels according to your furniture layout shifts, giving you total flexibility. We integrate automated dimming controllers to let you switch between bright functional light and cozy warm ambient settings with a click.</p>
<h3 class="font-luxury text-white h4 mt-5 mb-3">Why Choose Us as Your Local Sanpada Designers</h3>
<p class="text-muted">Clients in Sanpada choose us for our single-window turnkey execution. From initial 3D layouts to CIDCO permits, structural civil modifications, and final paint finishes, we handle everything with a 10-year warranty.</p>
